  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil and crackle the mustard seeds, cumin and fenugreek; add the curry leaves and garlic.",
    "Add the onions and green chillies and cook until soft and golden.",
    "Add the tomatoes, chilli powder, coriander powder, turmeric and salt and cook until mushy.",
    "Pour in the tamarind pulp and water, add the jaggery and simmer for 10 minutes until the raw tang mellows.",
    "Gently add the fish steaks and simmer on low heat for 8 to 10 minutes, shaking the pan rather than stirring.",
    "Rest for 10 minutes; the pulusu tastes better after standing."
  ]
